          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تصویر (tasvīr) is usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic taṣwīr, \"a picturing, a portrait\"."
            }
          ]
        },
